 "hast": "\n<p>One of the most requested features since launch has been layouts: admin dashboards with sidebar, marketing page sections, cards and more.</p>\n<p><strong>Today, we're launching <a href=\"/blocks\">Blocks</a>.</strong></p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"a\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/blocks&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/dashboard-1.jpg&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;716&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;430&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Admin dashboard&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border dark:hidden&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/dashboard-1-dark.jpg&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;716&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;430&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Admin dashboard&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 hidden w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm dark:block&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"span\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sr-only&#x22;}]\">View the blocks library</mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>\n<p>Blocks are ready-made components that you can use to build your apps. They are fully responsive, accessible, and composable, meaning they are built using the same principles as the rest of the components in shadcn/ui.</p>\n<p>We're starting with dashboard layouts and authentication pages, with plans to add more blocks in the coming weeks.</p>\n<h3 id=\"open-source\">Open Source</h3>\n<p>Blocks are open source. You can find the source on GitHub. Use them in your projects, customize them and contribute back.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"a\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/blocks&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/dashboard-2.jpg&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;716&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;420&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;AI Playground&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border dark:hidden&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/dashboard-2-dark.jpg&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;716&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;420&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;AI Playground&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 hidden w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm dark:block&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"span\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sr-only&#x22;}]\">View the blocks library</mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>\n<h3 id=\"request-a-block\">Request a Block</h3>\n<p>We're also introducing a \"Request a Block\" feature. If there's a specific block you'd like to see, simply create a request on GitHub and the community can upvote and build it.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"a\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/blocks&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/dashboard-3.jpg&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;716&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;420&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Settings Page&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border dark:hidden&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/dashboard-3-dark.jpg&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;716&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;420&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Settings Page&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 hidden w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm dark:block&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"span\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sr-only&#x22;}]\">View the blocks library</mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>\n<h3 id=\"v0\">v0</h3>\n<p>If you have a <a href=\"https://v0.dev\">v0</a> account, you can use the <strong>Edit in v0</strong> feature to open the code on v0 for prompting and further generation.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 flex aspect-video w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-background shadow-sm&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"svg\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;viewBox&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;0 0 40 20&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;fill&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;none&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;xmlns&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-40 w-40 text-foreground&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=